Run history: the last 4 evolve runs and last 5 CI runs succeeded. No reverts in 14 days.

Research: I saved the Claude Code changelog entry dated 2026-11-03 to yopedia. Ideas worth checking in yoyo, none probed yet:
• `-p` exit code: Claude Code's -p exited 0 when transcript writes failed. Does yoyo -p do the same when a save fails?
• Empty vs unset env var: stdio MCP servers got an empty credential variable instead of it being removed. That's the same shape as #1125.
• 403 errors: a region block was shown as a sign-in failure. yoyo's 403 diagnosis may have the same problem.

